note Trigger: keys::selects_line names the frame's gesture on the code block. A Press queues SelectLine for the line under the pointer unless it landed on the scrollbar track; a Drag queues it for the line the code block reports under the held pointer; any other press, or a frame with the button up, while line_grab is set queues ClearLineSelection.
